{"ID":"20240205172731-dsj3c87","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205172731-dsj3c87","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172731-dsj3c87\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172745-vjciq7e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172738-ynu41cc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172745-vjciq7e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:181,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:181\u0026#125;","title":"菝葜（金刚藤、铁菱角）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902172722"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172745-vjciq7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172745-vjciq7e","updated":"20240205172752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、江苏、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t根茎扁柱形，略弯曲，或不规则形，长1020cm，直径24cm。表面黄棕色或紫棕色，结节膨大处有圆锥状突起的茎痕、芽痕及细根断痕，或留有坚硬折断的细根，呈刺状，节上有鳞叶；有时先端残留地上茎。质坚硬，断面棕黄色或红棕色，粗纤维性。气微味，味微苦。产于江苏的较细而长，俗称\"金刚鞭\"；产于浙江的较粗壮，俗称\"铁菱角\"。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，平。\n【功效】\t祛风利湿；解毒消痈。主风湿痹痛；淋浊；带下；泄泻；痢疾；痈肿疮毒；顽癣；烧烫伤；解毒，驱风，疮科要药，有发汗，驱风，利尿及治淋病，癌症，消渴症的功用，叶捣烂外稃治恶疮。\n【注解】\t“筋脉”：指药材内部组织的纤维束或者维管束。当药材折断后，其纤维束和维管束呈参差不齐的丝状，又如人体的筋脉，在整齐的药材切面上看到的是其表现出的点状痕迹，又称为“筋脉点”。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172738-ynu41cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172738-ynu41cc","updated":"20240205172738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172738-hepy683.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724184204-0yrcpe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724184204-0yrcpe9","updated":"20240724185456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 340px;","style":"width: 330px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240724184204-7ghc01s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 330px;\" parent-style=\"width: 340px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 351px;","style":"width: 341px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"菝葜 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/菝葜 8-20240724185456-522x5a8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 341px;\" parent-style=\"width: 351px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724185534-s3e8pzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724185534-s3e8pzc","updated":"20240724185824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"菝葜 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/菝葜 9-20240724185534-1cehgqk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"菝葜 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/菝葜 10-20240724185606-exqxax4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240724184847-qruxbrm","Type":"NodeP